 "remarks": "Experience city living in this stunning top-floor corner residence, offering added privacy, abundant natural light, and beautiful downtown Stamford views. This 2BR/2BTH unit features an open floor plan, oversized windows, engineered hardwood floors, kitchen with granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and a breakfast bar. The spacious primary bedroom offers a large walk-in closet and private bath, plus the convenience of in-unit laundry. Recent upgrades include three replaced HVAC units (2021, 2024 & 2025), two tastefully renovated bathrooms, four new windows, a new oven and microwave, and fresh paint throughout. Includes two assigned parking spaces (one garage). The Windemere offers secure entry, elevator access, a renovated fitness center, outdoor terrace with BBQ grills, live-in superintendent, and is pet-friendly! Just a short walk to downtown restaurants, shopping, entertainment, and Metro-North. Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a move-in-ready home in a prime location!",
